You are an expert Senior Frontend Engineer with an eye for clean, human-designed, and highly professional B2B user interfaces. I need you to build a production-ready Frontend Dashboard Prototype for a Mangosteen (Manggis) Management System.

CRITICAL DESIGN PRINCIPLE: Avoid generic "AI-generated" looks. No unnecessary badges, no colorful gradients where they don't belong, no oversized floating icons inside cards, and no visual clutter. Make it look like a real, minimalist software designed by a human engineer for operational use in a warehouse/kiosk.

### 🛠️ TECH STACK
- Framework: Next.js (App Router, React)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Icons: lucide-react (Use very sparingly, only for actual UI utility)
- Charts: recharts (Keep it dead simple, clean lines, no heavy grid lines)
- State: Local React state with mock data

### 📏 SCREEN CONSTRAINT & ASPECT RATIO
- Aspect Ratio: Strict 9:16 portrait kiosk view.
- Hardcoded Canvas: Wrap the main container in `w-[1080px] h-[1920px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8 bg-[#f8fafc] text-slate-900`.
- Behavior: It must fit perfectly within these exact pixel dimensions without any vertical scrollbars or horizontal layout leaks.

### 🎨 MINIMALIST DESIGN SYSTEM & THEME
- Primary Color: Deep Mangosteen Purple (Use `#4A0E2E` or `text-[#4A0E2E]` / `bg-[#4A0E2E]` only for headers or primary indicators).
- Accent Status: Use standard flat semantic colors (`text-emerald-600` for positive/safe data, `text-amber-600` for warnings). No glowing shadows.
- Typography: Clean sans-serif, high contrast, precise font weights, and perfectly readable text tracking.
- Cards: Simple flat borders with extremely subtle shadows (`border border-slate-200/60 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]`).

### 📋 SCREEN STRUCTURE (FULLY INDONESIAN - TOP TO BOTTOM)

1. HEADER SECTION (Minimalist Bar):
   - Left: Small subtitle "PEMANTAUAN REAL-TIME" and main title "DASHBOARD MONITORING MANGGIS" in bold purple.
   - Right: Live digital clock (Format: HH.MM.SS) and the date "Minggu, 12 Juli 2026".
   - Status: A clean flat row containing a small green dot with "Terhubung" text and a simple text link button "Perbarui otomatis dalam 2:00".

2. RINGKASAN DATA (2x2 Clean Grid):
   - Card 1: TOTAL STOK TERSEDIA -> "1.250 Kg" (Large bold number, small text label).
   - Card 2: SIAP EKSPOR -> "450 Kg".
   - Card 3: RATA-RATA HARGA HARI INI -> "Rp 55.000 / Kg" (Include a small, clean "+4,5%" inline text trend).
   - Card 4: PERINGATAN KUALITAS -> "50 Kg" (Marked with subtle amber text, subtext: "Butuh sortir segera • Lihat detail ->").

3. TREN HARGA — 7 HARI TERAKHIR (Recharts Line Chart):
   - Clean area/line chart with a thin purple line (`#4A0E2E`) showing price fluctuations.
   - X-Axis Labels: "Sen", "Sel", "Rab", "Kam", "Jum", "Sab", "Min".
   - Y-Axis Labels: Must use Indonesian standard format shorthand for thousands (e.g., "51rb", "53rb", "54rb", "56rb") or full numbers ("51.000", "53.000"). No English "k" format.
   - Grid lines: Very faint or hidden completely to maximize data clarity.

4. STOK BERDASARKAN KUALITAS (Progress Bars):
   - Breakdown of categories with clean horizontal progress indicators:
     - Kelas A — Super / Ekspor: 600 Kg (Bar uses solid Deep Purple color, subtext: "48% dari total" in clean slate-500).
     - Kelas B — Standar / Lokal: 400 Kg (Bar uses Medium Purple opacity).
     - Kelas C — Industri Pengolahan: 250 Kg (Bar uses Light Purple opacity).
   - Ensure the percentage subtexts have high readability contrast against the light background.

5. AKTIVITAS TERBARU (Flat Operations Log):
   - A perfectly aligned list limited to exactly 6 items to cleanly balance the vertical space.
   - Examples: 
     - "10:30 — Diterima 200 Kg dari Petani A (Desa Sukamaju)"
     - "09:15 — Dikirim 400 Kg ke Pembeli X — PT Ekspor Nusantara"
     - "08:45 — Cek kualitas selesai — 150 Kg dinaikkan ke Kelas A"
   - Use absolute flat text formatting with clean aligned timestamps on the right side.

6. FOOTER CONTAINER:
   - Centered or left-aligned flat text: "Terakhir Diperbarui: 12 Jul 2026, 17.16.31". 
   - Clean, border-only refresh button text next to it if space permits, completely flat.

### ⚙️ CODE GENERATION RULES
- Output a single, beautifully organized React/Next.js component file.
- Use strict spacing classes (`gap-4`, `p-6`) optimized to keep the dashboard tightly packaged within the 1920px height ceiling without triggering overflow.
- Do not add random decorative icons, stars, cards background shapes, or bloated wrapper classes. Keep it human, minimal, and completely functional.